OL,3,GNEWSAVideo game football fans meet
OL,4,Areal-life team
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Basque grassroots football club which
OL,7,Fformed after spending hours playing as
OL,8,FReading on a video game have got to
OL,9,Fmeet the real players and watch them
OL,10,Fplay.
OL,12,FThe founding friends had returned to
OL,13,Fplaying the FIFA 07 video game two
OL,14,Fyears ago and took an interest in the
OL,15,FBerkshire club's history and even
OL,16,Fformed their own amateur football team
OL,17,Finspired by the Royals.
OL,19,FEuskoReading, from Northern Spain, also
OL,20,Fwear blue and white hoops and has a
OL,21,Fclub crest which looks similar to the
OL,22,FRoyals.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
