OL,3,GNEWSAVideo game football fans meet
OL,4,Areal-life team
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a social media post after seeing
OL,7,FReading beat Barnsley they said: "We've
OL,8,Fbeen following the club for years and
OL,9,Fhave finally achieved one of our
OL,10,Fbiggest dreams to watch Reading play
OL,11,Flive."
